        <h3>Where October 24 Fell in Each Run</h3>
        <p>The weeks split three ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{{N_FIRST}} songs were in their first week at number one: "My Ding-a-Ling," "Angie," "Nothing From Nothing," "If You Leave Me Now" and "Rise."</li>
          <li>{{N_MID}} were in the middle of a longer run: "I'll Be There," "Maggie May," "Bad Blood" and "You Light Up My Life."</li>
          <li>One, "Kiss You All Over," was in the last week of its run.</li>
        </ul>

