            <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiss_You_All_Over" rel="noopener">Kiss You All Over, Wikipedia</a>, for the writers, the producer and the synthesizer strings.</li>
            <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rise_(Herb_Alpert_song)" rel="noopener">Rise (Herb Alpert song), Wikipedia</a>, for the writers, the album and Alpert's 1968 number one.</li>
            <li><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Billboard_Hot_100" rel="noopener">Billboard Hot 100, Wikipedia</a>, for how the weekly chart used for number one runs works.</li>
